]2[.] Baking soda[ scrub]: Baking soda is also effective in treating blackheads. It helps[ get] rid of all the dirt, grime from[ deep] within the[ pores]. So make a thick paste of baking soda and mineral[ water][ and][ massage] the affected areas[ gently][ with] this paste for a few minutes[.] Let[ it] dry and then rinse it off with l[uke]warm[ water][.] Use this[ remedy] twice a week[ for][ best] results.
