][Next][ was][ the][ camera][.][ I] have a Canon Rebel 35mm film SL[R][ that][ I][ bought] on eBay for $[1]. It had controller[ issues], but thankfully[ the][ camera] just so happened to work[ set] to[ manual][.][ I] gave the[ inside][ a] coat[ of] u[reth]ane[,] set up some glass[ guides][ to][ hold] a[ plate] and[ shot] it[.] 600[mm][,] f/4 –[ ten] seconds[.] And that[�][�][s] the[ plate] you see[ to] the right.
